& [Structure]
  + one safe Rust module owns exact constants strict forms validators deterministic plan receipts faults and effect-broker orchestration
  + one explicit preparer CLI accepts only the exact source identity and one verifier CLI reads one evidence directory
  + fake brokers provide exhaustive provider-free unit and integration coverage without touching the reserved root or ref

& [PreEffect]
  + validate source lineage published carrier and bookend owner volume root ref parent remote equality ancestry executable environment and capacity
  + render and digest the complete effect plan before creating anything

& [Effect]
  + create scratch evidence temp and codex-home then launch exactly one worktree-add command
  + retain the created branch common-dir worktree metadata and checkout
  + observe only the closed post-effect Git and filesystem plan

& [Evidence]
  + producer emits strict raw request plan process observation inventory consequence and provisional receipt artifacts
  + independent verifier rehashes and replays those forms twice to one canonical receipt
  + NotRun and Quarantined cannot carry Prepared fields or authority

& [Separation]
  + preparation produces no Phase3A freshness or P1 transcript
  + Phase3A acquisition and P1 physical contact require later separately signed and verified work

& [Result]
  + target result is one retained clean external candidate eligible only for later Phase3A acquisition
  + no result grants writer provider model MCP commit push activation cleanup or product authority
